docs {
Detach FCM token perangkat ini (logout). Soft-delete by udid + user login.
Device lain milik user tetap aktif.

Body:

    { "udid": "device-stable-id" }

200 (idempotent - revoked false jika sudah tidak aktif):

    { "success": true, "data": { "udid": "device-stable-id", "revoked": true } }
}

meta {
  name: Revoke Device Token
  seq: 2
}

patch {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/device/revoke
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{accessToken}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "udid": "{{deviceUdid}}"
  }
}
